      "Type": "string",
      "InitialValue": "THANH CONG: Da rai 1994 doi tuong [DPC_L=3M] bam theo 3D Polyline (Layer: C-TOPO-FEAT)! (Tong L = 6003.2m, Toa do & cao do bam 100% theo duong dan CAD). Kich thuoc: L=3.0m, H=0.9m, W=0.6m, Khe ho=0.01m (Buoc rai=3.01m) | Cao do thuc dia Z ~ 12.45m (Z Offset=0.0m) | Tham so: [L=3.0m] | [LOI BIM]: Da gan ma [DPC-KM52-0001 -> DPC-KM52-1994], Goi thau XL01 | Km52+000 - Km60+000, BTXM M300 (C25/30) - TCVN 12681:2019, Lien danh XL01 | Cho nghiem thu",
