      {
        "Id": "20437a355a1155f78389f1f59cbcd2b6",
        "Title": "=== HUONG DAN SU DUNG CONG CU RAI ATGT (DPC / TON SONG / LUOI / RAO) ===\n\n1. LENH SELECT: Click nut 'Select' o muc [1] -> Click chon duong tim tuyen tren Revit (3D Polyline, Model Line LI, hoac CAD).\n2. CHON FAMILY: Chon kieu Family o muc [2] (DPC_L=5M, TS-ZZ-GUA, Luoi chong choi...).\n3. KICH THUOC: Nhap Chieu dai L, Chieu cao H, Be rong W va Khe ho mong ngam -> Tool tu dong tinh buoc rai va gan tham so Revit.\n4. GOC XOAY: Mac dinh 0.0 do (song song doc theo tim tuyen). Neu can quay 90 do thi nhap 90 hoac -90.\n5. THUC THI: Bam nut 'Run' (hoac nut Play trong Dynamo Player) de hoan thanh!",
        "DescriptionText": null,
